					<description><![CDATA[The Bauxite Historical Association Museum (BHAM) invites the public aged 18+ to charity bingo night Saturday, August 22, 2026. READ MORE BELOW When Doors open at 4 p.m. Games begin at 5 p.m.  Where The address is 6707 Benton Road, Bauxite, Ar. It&#8217;s the big yellow building with columns.  Directions from Benton: Take Edison/Hwy 183 [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM.png"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-110955" src="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM-600x503.png" alt="" width="444" height="372" srcset="https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM-600x503.png 600w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM-300x251.png 300w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM-150x126.png 150w, https://www.mysaline.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/bingo-BAUXITE-HISTORICAL-ASSOCIATION-MUSEUM.png 940w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 444px) 100vw, 444px" /></a></p>
<hr />
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">The Bauxite Historical Association Museum (BHAM) invites the public aged 18+ to charity bingo night Saturday, August 22, 2026.</span></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;"><strong><span style="color: #ff6600;">READ MORE BELOW</span></strong></span></p>
<p><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;"><script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9318701447515491" crossorigin="anonymous"></script></span><br />
<span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;"><!-- in articles - 2023 july --></span><br />
<ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display: block;" data-ad-client="ca-pub-9318701447515491" data-ad-slot="1423088530" data-ad-format="auto" data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins><br />
<span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;"><script>
     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
</script></span></p>
<p><strong><span style="color: #ff6600; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;">When</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Doors open at 4 p.m. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Games begin at 5 p.m. </span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span style="color: #ff6600; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;">Where</span></strong></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">The address is 6707 Benton Road, Bauxite, Ar. It&#8217;s the big yellow building with columns. </span></span></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Directions from Benton:</span> Take Edison/Hwy 183 and turn right before Bauxite Post Office. </span></span></p>
<p style="padding-left: 40px;"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Directions from Bryant:</span> Take Reynolds/Hwy 183 and turn left after Bauxite Post Office.</span></span></p>
<p><strong><span style="color: #ff6600; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; text-decoration-line: underline;">Games</span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Backups must be purchased with Pack. Ten games per pack. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Mini – 4 games of Chicken Feed and 1 game of Checkmark. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">Must have Mini Pack to Play Checkmark game.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #ff6600; text-decoration: underline;">Prices</span></span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Pack</strong> – 10 games plus Early Bird Mini of five games plus one free game/card-$15.00 </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Backup</strong> – 10 games (identical to Pack of 10 games) &#8211; $10.00 </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><strong>Minis/Special Games</strong> – Games 9, 12, 16, 19 and 21- $1.00 per card or 6 cards for $5.00</span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><strong>No checks will be accepted.</strong> </span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="color: #ff6600; text-decoration: underline;">Important Details</span></span></strong></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">There will be concessions. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">There&#8217;s </span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">a 50/50 raffle. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;">No outside food or drink will be allowed. </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;">This is a smoke free environment but it is allowed outside.</span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;">Proceeds to benefit Bauxite Historical Association Museum (BHAM).</span></li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;"><span style="color: #ff6600; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 20px;"><b> See MySaline&#8217;s list of all the events in Saline County at <span style="color: #ff6600;"><a style="color: #ff6600;" href="http://www.mysaline.com/events">www.mysaline.com/events</a></span></b></span></span></p>
<hr />
<p>&nbsp;</p>
